Third-party components
----------------------

The following parts are not covered by this notice and keep their own license:

- circuits/: the ballot and tally circuits are built on circomlib
  (GPL-3.0) and are under AGPL-3.0-only.
- contracts/contracts/verifiers/: Groth16 verifiers generated by snarkjs,
  under GPL-3.0, as stated in their headers.
- Dependencies installed from npm and other registries, under their own
  licenses.

